#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:11
msgid "Zero FOUC"
msgstr "零闪烁(FOUC)"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:12
msgid ""
"A synchronous inline script resolves the theme before first paint - on "
"every framework, not just Next.js."
msgstr "同步内联脚本在首次绘制前完成主题解析——对所有框架生效,而不只是 Next.js。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:15
msgid "No React 19 warnings"
msgstr "没有 React 19 警告"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:16
msgid ""
"The script renders from your server layout, never from a client component, "
"so remounts cannot trigger the \"script tag while rendering\" error."
msgstr "脚本由 server layout 渲染,从不经过客户端组件,路由重挂载不可能触发 \"script tag while rendering\" 错误。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:19
msgid "Server-side reading"
msgstr "服务端读取"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:20
msgid ""
"Cookie mode lets loaders, server components and server functions know the "
"theme - getTheme() for Next.js, getThemeFromRequest() everywhere else."
msgstr "Cookie 模式让 loader、服务端组件和 server function 都能读到主题——Next.js 用 getTheme(),其他框架用 getThemeFromRequest()。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:23
msgid "Framework-agnostic core"
msgstr "框架无关内核"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:24
msgid ""
"A plain DOM store with a 30-line useSyncExternalStore binding. Next.js, "
"React Router, TanStack Start and Vite ship as subpath entries."
msgstr "纯 DOM store 加 30 行 useSyncExternalStore 绑定。Next.js、React Router、TanStack Start 和 Vite 以子路径入口提供。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:32
msgid ""
"Theme switching for React apps — zero-FOUC, React 19 safe, and it works the "
"same in Next.js, React Router, TanStack Start and Vite."
msgstr "React 应用的主题切换——零闪烁、React 19 安全,在 Next.js、React Router、TanStack Start 和 Vite 中行为一致。"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/page.tsx:42
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: src/app/layout.with.tsx:21
msgid ""
"Theme switching for React apps: framework-agnostic core, zero-FOUC inline "
"script, no React 19 script warnings."
msgstr "React 应用的主题切换:框架无关内核、零闪烁内联脚本、没有 React 19 script 警告。"
